{"pageid":4165,"title":"King Statues","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">King Statues</span>","revid":19889,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>(The current author cannot confirm the accuracy of the information on this page, please add if you have more informations)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"King_Statues\">King Statues</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 198px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/King_statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616184633\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"An image of the King Statue next to the Pyramid\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/King_statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/198?cb=20250616184633\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"198\" height=\"212\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"King statue.png\" data-image-key=\"King_statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:King_statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">An image of the King Statue next to the Pyramid</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The King statues are structures that can be found around the desert with different colored crowns and symbols. The use of the statues is yet unknown.\n</p><p>There exists a small map of the desert under the pyramid, accessible by the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a>. Another entrance to this cave can be found by the sea, west of the pyramid. On this map you can see the locations of the statues. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 666px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0b/MapDesert.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616185727\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The small map representing the desert\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0b/MapDesert.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/666?cb=20250616185727\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"666\" height=\"519\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"MapDesert.png\" data-image-key=\"MapDesert.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:MapDesert.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The small map representing the desert</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 312px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/48/StatueFire.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616190136\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A King Statue with a fire symbol\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/48/StatueFire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/312?cb=20250616190136\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"312\" height=\"276\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"StatueFire.png\" data-image-key=\"StatueFire.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:StatueFire.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A King Statue with a fire symbol</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Most of the statues have symbols that most likely correspond to the swords from the ROBLOX game <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/47324/Sword-Fights-on-the-Heights-IV\">Sword Fight on the Heights IV</a>. The statues also hold swords that use the same mesh as the SFOTH swords. Due to the SFOTH link, the <a href=\"/wiki/Linked_Sword\" title=\"Linked Sword\">Linked Sword</a> (the starter SFOTH sword) may be relevant to the statues.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<caption>List of Statues\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Statue\n</th>\n<th>Corresponding Sword\n</th>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Black King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Darkheart\">Darkheart</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Darkheart_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004412\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darkheart King Statue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"235\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Darkheart King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Darkheart_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Darkheart_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004412\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Darkheart_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004412\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darkheart King Statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Darkheart_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004412\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"235\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Darkheart King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Darkheart_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Darkheart_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004412\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Darkheart_King_Statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Black colour (<b>Dark</b>heart)\n<p>- Broken heart (Dark<b>heart</b>)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Firebrand\">Firebrand</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Firebrand_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004513\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Firebrand King Statue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"102\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Firebrand King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Firebrand_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Firebrand_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004513\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Firebrand_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004513\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Firebrand King Statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Firebrand_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004513\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"102\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Firebrand King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Firebrand_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d9/Firebrand_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004513\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Firebrand_King_Statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Fire (<b>Fire</b>brand)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Light Blue King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Windforce\">Windforce</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Windforce_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004625\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Windforce King Statue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"189\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Windforce King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Windforce_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Windforce_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004625\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Windforce_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004625\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Windforce King Statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Windforce_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004625\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"189\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Windforce King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Windforce_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/Windforce_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004625\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Windforce_King_Statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Wind (<b>Wind</b>force)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Venomshank\">Venomshank</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/ca/Venomshank_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Venomshank King Statue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"195\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Venomshank King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Venomshank_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/ca/Venomshank_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004707\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/ca/Venomshank_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Venomshank King Statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/ca/Venomshank_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004707\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"195\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Venomshank King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Venomshank_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/ca/Venomshank_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004707\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Venomshank_King_Statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xl