/figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>- Stars (Sparkle effect emitted by the Illumina in SFOTH)\n<p>- It's high-up location may reference the platform the Illumina is found on in SFOTH\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue King Statue\n</td>\n<td><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Icedagger\">Icedagger</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/Icedagger_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004924\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Icedagger King Statue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"112\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icedagger King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Icedagger_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/Icedagger_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004924\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/Icedagger_King_Statue.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703004924\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Icedagger King Statue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/Icedagger_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004924\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"112\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Icedagger King Statue.png\" data-image-key=\"Icedagger_King_Statue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/62/Icedagger_King_Statue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250703004924\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Icedagger_King_Statue.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=